01:20:28.680 --> 01:20:30.260
Of course, I am!

01:20:31.950 --> 01:20:34.180
We saw a real live UFO!

01:20:34.180 --> 01:20:36.930
Lucky, Lucky, real lucky!

01:20:36.930 --> 01:20:38.610
We saw a real live UFO!

01:20:38.610 --> 01:20:39.860
All right!
We saw a real live UFO!

01:20:39.860 --> 01:20:40.260
All right!

01:20:40.260 --> 01:20:41.540
Real lucky!

01:20:41.540 --> 01:20:44.590
Ai, the miracle really happened!

01:20:45.030 --> 01:20:45.770
Yeah!

01:20:47.610 --> 01:20:53.510
How about it! The winner of this year's contest should be Ai!

01:20:54.330 --> 01:20:59.760
Using the stars to light up the sky, it's the first time it's ever happened.

01:20:59.760 --> 01:21:02.040
